<b></b>Komori

06:40.500 --> 06:58.390
<b></b>Saejima

06:40.500 --> 06:58.390
<b></b>Himuro

06:40.910 --> 06:43.350
<i>My first online drink!</i>

06:44.800 --> 06:47.040
<i>What's everyone else drinking?</i>

06:47.040 --> 06:49.470
<i>Wow, that was one wild chug!</i>

06:49.470 --> 06:50.520
<i>It's barley tea.</i>

06:50.520 --> 06:52.490
<i>Aw, what gives?</i>

06:52.490 --> 06:56.800
<i>Lately, I like to start with tea 
before hitting the harder stuff.</i>

06:57.360 --> 06:58.390
<i>Huh?</i>

06:58.390 --> 07:00.890
<i>Himuro-kun, you seem pretty down.</i>

07:00.890 --> 07:03.240
I'm sorry.

07:03.240 --> 07:07.290
I'm alone here, so I don't quite 
know how to approach this.

07:07.290 --> 07:09.040
<i>It's okay to just chill, I think.</i>

07:09.030 --> 07:17.540
<b></b>Saejima

07:09.040 --> 07:12.340
Saejima-kun, is that a virtual 
background you've got?

07:12.340 --> 07:13.650
It's all white, though...

07:13.650 --> 07:15.410
<i>I'm in my room.</i>

07:15.410 --> 07:17.530
<i>The background is just my white wall.</i>

07:17.540 --> 07:24.170
<b></b>Komori

07:19.170 --> 07:21.680
<i>That's the Saejima-kun I know!</i>

07:21.680 --> 07:24.160
<i>Komori-san, are you streaming 
from a Japanese-style room?</i>

07:24.160 --> 07:26.640
Yeah, since I'm at my parents' house.

07:26.640 --> 07:29.170
<i>Where do your parents live?</i>

07:29.170 --> 07:34.430
<b></b>Komori

07:29.170 --> 07:34.430
<b></b>Saejima

07:29.170 --> 07:34.430
<b></b>Himuro

07:29.170 --> 07:34.430
<b></b>Fuyutsuki

07:29.700 --> 07:31.820
<i>Hey, here's our girl!</i>

07:31.820 --> 07:34.440
<i>I'm sorry. I had trouble setting up.</i>

07:34.800 --> 07:35.990
Welcome.

07:35.990 --> 07:37.240
<i>Thank you for having me.</i>

07:36.600 --> 07:40.430
<i>Seeing Fuyutsuki-san on-screen... 
A wonderful new experience!</i>

07:40.850 --> 07:43.590
<i>Well, let's have a new toast.</i>

07:43.590 --> 07:44.560
<i>All right.</i>

07:44.560 --> 07:44.690
<b>Chuhai</b>

07:44.560 --> 07:47.940
<b></b>Komori

07:44.690 --> 07:44.810
<b>Chuhai</b>

07:44.810 --> 07:44.940
<b>Chuhai</b>

07:44.940 --> 07:45.060
<b>Chuhai</b>

07:45.040 --> 07:47.950
<i>Okay, then! Cheers!</i>

07:45.060 --> 07:45.190
<b>Chuhai</b>

07:45.190 --> 07:47.940
<b>Chuhai</b>

07:47.940 --> 07:51.570
<b></b>Komori

07:47.940 --> 07:51.570
<b></b>Saejima

07:47.940 --> 07:51.570
<b></b>Himuro

07:47.940 --> 07:51.570
<b></b>Fuyutsuki

07:47.940 --> 07:51.570
<i>Great work getting through the year! Yeah!</i>

07:47.950 --> 07:49.080
<i>Cheers.</i>

07:52.110 --> 07:54.780
<i>Fuyutsuki-san, you and 
Himuro-san have the same drink.</i>

07:54.780 --> 07:55.930
You're right.

07:55.930 --> 07:58.040
I've quite liked this brand recently.

07:58.040 --> 08:00.200
The tropical mango, especially.

08:00.200 --> 08:01.640
<i>I feel the same way!</i>

08:00.200 --> 08:06.590
<b></b>Komori

08:00.200 --> 08:06.590
<b></b>Saejima

08:00.200 --> 08:06.590
<b></b>Himuro

08:00.200 --> 08:06.590
<b></b>Fuyutsuki

08:01.640 --> 08:03.980
<i>Yeah, yeah. Very cozy.</i>

08:03.980 --> 08:06.580
<i>What are you drinking, Saejima-kun?</i>

08:08.760 --> 08:09.870
Roasted green tea.

08:09.870 --> 08:12.720
<i>Still non-alcoholic?!</i>

08:12.940 --> 08:14.050
That reminds me!

08:14.050 --> 08:16.600
Fuyutsuki-san, you have a cat, don't you?

08:16.600 --> 08:18.760
<i>Bring on the kitty!</i>

08:18.760 --> 08:20.400
Shall I?

08:21.610 --> 08:23.240
Nyame-chan...

08:27.610 --> 08:28.850
Here we a—

08:28.860 --> 08:30.860
<b>Fuyutsuki</b>

08:39.720 --> 08:42.080
D-Did you see?

08:43.000 --> 08:43.950
No...

08:43.950 --> 08:47.490
<i>Fuyutsuki-san blushing over wearing 
her high school track pants is so cute!</i>

08:47.490 --> 08:50.280
Is that a virtual background, Himuro-san?

08:47.500 --> 08:52.760
<b></b>Himuro

08:50.280 --> 08:51.330
Or natural?

08:51.330 --> 08:52.760
<i>It's natural.</i>

08:52.760 --> 08:55.240
<i>Drinkin' at home is the best!</i>

08:52.760 --> 08:55.240
<i>I let my guard down.</i>

08:55.240 --> 08:56.990
<i>Hey, it's fine!</i>

08:56.990 --> 08:59.140
<i>I'm just in my undies.</i>

08:59.140 --> 09:01.080
<i>You better be even more careful!</i>

09:01.750 --> 09:03.010
<i>Sorry I'm late!</i>

09:03.020 --> 09:13.530
<b></b>Komori

09:03.020 --> 09:13.530
<b></b>Saejima

09:03.020 --> 09:13.530
<b></b>Himuro

09:03.020 --> 09:13.530
<b></b>Fuyutsuki

09:03.830 --> 09:05.860
<i>We made it!</i>

09:05.860 --> 09:07.880
<i>Both of you at once?!</i>

09:07.880 --> 09:11.000
<i>I was having trouble setting up 
the virtual background,</i>

09:11.000 --> 09:13.520
<i>so Otonashi-san walked me through it!</i>

09:13.520 --> 09:15.560
<i>Where did you get yours from?</i>

09:16.030 --> 09:19.490
<i>Oh, I made it during my artist days.</i>

09:19.490 --> 09:22.720
<i>I call it "The Light of Worldly Desires."</i>

09:22.720 --> 09:24.660
<i>Perfect for New Year's Eve, huh?</i>

09:24.660 --> 09:27.120
<i>Otonashi-san, you went virtual, too?</i>

09:27.120 --> 09:29.410
<i>Well, my room's kind of a mess.</i>

09:29.410 --> 09:30.930
<i>What a coincidence!</i>

09:30.930 --> 09:33.800
<i>My room's a big old mess, too!</i>

09:33.800 --> 09:37.120
<i>You haven't done your cleaning yet?</i>

09:37.120 --> 09:41.310
<i>I w-wanted to get a head start, 
so I did it in early December,</i>

09:41.310 --> 09:44.400
<i>but by New Year's Eve, 
it was unpresentable again...</i>

09:44.400 --> 09:46.310
<i>A surprise klutz!</i>

09:46.310 --> 09:48.340
<i>I can't keep up with my cleaning!</i>

09:48.340 --> 09:49.790
<i>Wanna take a peek?</i>

09:49.790 --> 09:51.450
<i>You're going to show it anyway?</i>

09:51.450 --> 09:55.310
<i>Let's see. To turn off virtual background...</i>

09:55.310 --> 09:58.070
Forget it and let's have a toast!

09:58.070 --> 09:59.280
<i>One, two...</i>

09:58.070 --> 10:00.820
<b></b>Komori

09:58.070 --> 10:00.820
<b></b>Saejima

09:58.070 --> 10:00.820
<b></b>Himuro

09:58.070 --> 10:00.820
<b></b>Fuyutsuki

09:59.280 --> 10:00.810
<i>Cheers!</i>

10:01.120 --> 10:03.090
You've got beer, Otonashi-san?

10:03.560 --> 10:05.550
<i>Yep! Microbrew!</i>

10:05.550 --> 10:07.580
<i>I like it with a little kick.</i>

10:07.580 --> 10:09.540
<i>What about yours, Saejima-kun?</i>

10:09.540 --> 10:10.850
Chameleon plant tea.

10:10.850 --> 10:13.230
<i>You're still not drinking?!</i>

10:13.230 --> 10:14.920
I'm just about to start.

10:14.920 --> 10:16.600
<i>Hey, vodka!</i>

10:16.600 --> 10:18.840
<i>I dropped my virtual background!</i>

10:18.840 --> 10:21.800
That seems a little beyond just messy...

10:21.800 --> 10:23.820
<i>I just moved, actually!</i>

10:24.600 --> 10:26.400
After the whole Halloween thing,

10:26.400 --> 10:29.340
I realized just how far 
I lived from the office.

10:29.340 --> 10:30.950
<i>And now you live closer?</i>

10:30.950 --> 10:32.010
It's a five-minute walk!

10:32.010 --> 10:33.200
<i>That's closer, all right!</i>

10:33.200 --> 10:35.610
<i>You seem to have a lot of possessions.</i>

10:35.610 --> 10:37.730
<i>It's all my art!</i>

10:37.730 --> 10:39.610
<i>Packing it all up took forever!</i>

10:39.990 --> 10:41.740
<i>Oh, wanna see?</i>

10:42.090 --> 10:45.990
<i>This one's called "A New Journey 
Into the Setbacks of Youth."</i>

10:45.990 --> 10:49.690
<i>And this one's "An Etude 
for Three Days From Now."</i>

10:50.630 --> 10:53.330
<i>And this one...</i>

10:53.980 --> 10:57.120
<i>Oh, this one's a kagami mochi.</i>

11:00.150 --> 11:02.390
I've gotten pretty buzzed.

11:02.390 --> 11:04.890
Hey, Komori-san. You're not drinking?

11:04.890 --> 11:07.720
I stopped after one.

11:07.720 --> 11:09.900
I've got stuff I need to do after this.

11:09.900 --> 11:12.640
<i>At this hour? On New Year's Eve?</i>

11:12.640 --> 11:16.040
Hey, do you guys wanna make our first 
shrine visit of the year together tomorrow?

11:16.320 --> 11:17.680
That's a lovely idea.

11:17.680 --> 11:19.900
Maybe I'll wear a kimono.

11:19.900 --> 11:22.210
<i>First shrine visit of the new year 
with Fuyutsuki-san?!</i>

11:22.210 --> 11:23.780
<i>And she'll be in a kimono?!</i>

11:23.780 --> 11:29.090
Himuro-kun, you're back to a background 
that somehow looks both virtual and real.

11:23.780 --> 11:30.040
<b></b>Himuro

11:29.090 --> 11:30.040
<i>It's natural!</i>

11:30.040 --> 11:34.040
Then let's all hit up the 
shrine tomorrow in kimono!

11:34.040 --> 11:35.850
Are you in, Otonashi-san?

11:35.850 --> 11:36.920
<i>Any time!</i>

11:36.920 --> 11:40.670
<b></b>Komori

11:36.920 --> 11:41.330
Actually, I've got family business 
on New Year's Day, too...

11:40.800 --> 11:43.430
<b></b>Saejima

11:41.330 --> 11:43.430
<i>What, really?</i>

11:43.430 --> 11:46.660
<i>So I'd better call it here.</i>

11:43.430 --> 11:51.310
<b></b>Komori

11:43.430 --> 11:51.310
<b></b>Saejima

11:43.430 --> 11:51.310
<b></b>Himuro

11:43.430 --> 11:51.310
<b></b>Fuyutsuki

11:46.660 --> 11:47.970
<i>Happy New Year.</i>

11:47.970 --> 11:49.400
<i>Happy New Year!</i>

11:49.400 --> 11:51.320
<i>Happy New Year!</i>

11:51.320 --> 11:54.740
Komori-san said she was 
staying with her parents.

11:54.740 --> 11:56.560
<i>Yeah, makes sense, I guess.</i>

11:56.560 --> 11:59.550
I wonder where her parents live.

11:59.550 --> 12:02.090
<i>Yeah, I forgot to ask...</i>

12:02.090 --> 12:05.200
<i>So what shrine should we go to tomorrow?</i>

12:05.200 --> 12:07.700
<i>We really should choose 
someplace appropriate.</i>

12:07.700 --> 12:10.080
<i>What do you want to wish for, Otonashi-san?</i>

12:10.080 --> 12:12.870
<i>Work? Health? Roma—</i>

12:11.790 --> 12:12.870
<i>Work!</i>

12:12.870 --> 12:14.880
<i>That's the Otonashi-san I know!</i>

12:14.880 --> 12:16.390
<i>But hang on a minute.</i>

12:16.390 --> 12:18.590
<i>For the new year, 
you could also add romance—</i>

12:18.910 --> 12:21.310
What about the Inari Shrine 
on the main avenue?

12:21.310 --> 12:24.080
It's close enough to all our homes.

12:24.080 --> 12:25.520
Sounds great.

12:25.520 --> 12:27.850
How about we meet up 
tomorrow afternoon at three?

12:27.850 --> 12:29.090
<i>You're on!</i>

12:29.090 --> 12:31.440
<i>Well, I should be going now.</i>

12:29.100 --> 12:34.340
<b></b>Saejima

12:29.100 --> 12:34.340
<b></b>Himuro

12:29.100 --> 12:34.340
<b></b>Fuyutsuki

12:31.440 --> 12:33.680
<i>Oh? Then I'll be going, too!</i>

12:34.350 --> 12:36.220
<i>I should go, too.</i>

12:34.480 --> 12:39.880
<b></b>Saejima

12:34.480 --> 12:40.380
<b></b>Himuro

12:34.480 --> 12:40.380
<b></b>Fuyutsuki

12:36.220 --> 12:37.760
<i>Happy New Year!</i>

12:38.260 --> 12:39.850
<i>Happy New Year.</i>

12:40.480 --> 12:40.600
<b></b>Himuro

12:40.480 --> 12:40.600
<b></b>Fuyutsuki

12:43.430 --> 12:45.610
I've run out.

12:45.610 --> 12:48.600
Same here. I should have bought more.

12:49.030 --> 12:51.440
But we have a big day tomorrow.

12:51.440 --> 12:54.110
Maybe it's best to leave it at this.

12:55.290 --> 12:57.120
Yes, that's true.

13:06.320 --> 13:09.510
Happy New Year.

13:09.510 --> 13:12.880
Happy New Year.

13:12.880 --> 13:15.890
<i>I'll be going now.</i>

13:12.890 --> 13:18.650
<b></b>Himuro

13:12.890 --> 13:18.650
<b></b>Fuyutsuki

13:15.890 --> 13:18.050
<i>Yes. I'll see you tomorrow.</i>

13:18.900 --> 13:19.890
<b></b>Himuro

13:24.540 --> 13:26.030
I look forward

13:27.000 --> 13:29.070
to spending another year with you.

13:34.770 --> 13:36.640
They're all pretty late.

13:37.070 --> 13:39.360
Wonder where Fuyutsuki-san is...

13:40.250 --> 13:42.750
<b>Donations</b>

13:40.250 --> 13:43.490
<b>Fortunes</b>

13:43.760 --> 13:45.580
Maybe I'll pull a fortune.

13:43.760 --> 13:50.760
<b>Fortunes</b>

13:43.760 --> 13:50.760
<b>Donations</b>

13:50.760 --> 13:53.770
<b>Bad Luck
The one you're waiting for will not arrive. 
Your wishes will not come true.
You will not find lost articles.</b>

13:52.460 --> 13:53.760
Bad luck.

13:54.130 --> 13:56.270
N-No way!

13:56.270 --> 13:57.630
One more time!

13:56.270 --> 13:58.020
<b>Fortunes</b>

13:56.270 --> 13:58.020
<b>Donations</b>

13:58.020 --> 14:00.020
<b>Worst Luck 
The one you're waiting for will <i>not</i> arrive. 
Your wishes will <i>not</i> come true.
You will <i>not</i> find lost articles.</b>

13:58.380 --> 14:00.020
Worst luck?!

14:01.520 --> 14:03.020
<b>Fortunes</b>

14:01.520 --> 14:03.020
<b>Donations</b>

14:01.520 --> 14:03.030
O-One more time!

14:03.020 --> 14:07.780
<b>Extra Worst Luck 
The one you're waiting for will <i>never</i> arrive. 
Your wishes will <i>never</i> come true.
You will <i>never</i> find lost articles.</b>

14:03.400 --> 14:04.770
Extra worst luck?!

14:16.600 --> 14:18.430
Just a dream...

14:18.850 --> 14:20.800
It's noon, Big Bro.

14:21.290 --> 14:23.120
You're going on your 
first shrine visit, right?

14:23.120 --> 14:25.300
Better hurry, or you'll be late!

14:25.750 --> 14:27.260
Oh, right.

14:27.260 --> 14:30.070
I almost ended up bein' late.

14:30.070 --> 14:34.440
Still... that was a heck of an ominous 
first dream of the new year.

14:47.440 --> 14:49.970
Himuro! Over here!

14:51.160 --> 14:53.200
Happy New Year!

14:53.200 --> 14:54.710
Happy New Year.

14:55.850 --> 14:57.870
Happy New Year.

14:57.870 --> 15:00.200
It's pretty cool seeing you all in kimono.

15:00.200 --> 15:02.370
Yeah, since we don't usually wear them.

15:05.210 --> 15:08.760
I was a little down after having a 
pretty bad first dream of the year,

15:08.760 --> 15:12.160
but seeing Otonashi-san in a kimono
 brought me right back to life!

15:13.070 --> 15:15.230
<i>He's the one who made those fireworks, then?</i>

15:15.750 --> 15:17.580
What kind of dream did you have?

15:17.580 --> 15:22.110
I went to a modern art exhibit, 
and for some reason I saw—

15:22.530 --> 15:25.960
<i>That's right, I had that ominous dream, too!</i>

15:25.960 --> 15:26.900
<i>Wait a minute...</i>

15:27.610 --> 15:29.320
Where's Fuyutsuki-san?

15:29.320 --> 15:30.730
Haven't seen her yet.

15:30.730 --> 15:33.440
We did arrive a bit early.

15:33.440 --> 15:34.740
I'm sure she'll be here soon.

15:36.260 --> 15:37.450
What's the matter?

15:37.880 --> 15:39.240
Oh, nothing.

15:39.240 --> 15:41.420
My first dream of the year 
was that no one showed up,

15:41.420 --> 15:45.000
and all the fortunes I drew 
were bad luck ones.

15:45.000 --> 15:47.630
Hey, that's no good.

15:49.920 --> 15:51.380
Don't worry.

15:51.380 --> 15:53.400
The "first dream of the 
new year" isn't the one

15:53.400 --> 15:56.040
you have on New Year's morning, 
but the morning of the 2nd.

15:56.700 --> 16:00.160
Opinions vary, but apparently, 
that's the most common belief.

16:03.140 --> 16:04.260
Fuyutsuki-san!

16:10.100 --> 16:12.360
Happy New Year.

16:14.160 --> 16:16.700
Happy New Year!

16:16.700 --> 16:18.280
Happy New Year.

16:19.610 --> 16:21.160
Happy...

16:21.160 --> 16:23.040
Oh, I said that already.

16:25.000 --> 16:27.690
<i>What a freakin' blessing for the new year!</i>

16:27.690 --> 16:29.800
<i>A goddess in a kimono!</i>

16:31.130 --> 16:33.720
<i>Guess we're in for another 
year of fun with Himuro!</i>

16:34.300 --> 16:38.300
<b>Okonomiyaki  </b>Special Takoyaki  <b>Frankfurters</b>

16:34.300 --> 16:38.300
<b>Okonomiyaki  </b>Special Takoyaki  <b>Frankfurters</b>

16:38.300 --> 16:40.100
It's very crowded.

16:40.100 --> 16:42.560
You think we'll make it to the temple?

16:42.560 --> 16:44.680
They've got takoyaki!

16:45.190 --> 16:46.810
Hey, Katori!

16:50.570 --> 16:52.730
And just like that, we're separated.

16:52.730 --> 16:56.410
We got separated in Nekomi Land, too.

16:56.410 --> 16:57.320
Yes...

16:57.320 --> 17:01.830
<i>I'd get separated anywhere, 
anytime with Fuyutsuki-san!</i>

17:01.830 --> 17:10.090
<b>Grilled Squid</b>

17:01.830 --> 17:10.090
<b>Special Doll Cakes</b>

17:01.830 --> 17:10.090
<b>Sweet Sake</b>

17:02.200 --> 17:04.940
We should head to the main temple regardless.

17:04.940 --> 17:06.440
We might encounter them on the way.

17:06.440 --> 17:08.230
Y-Yes, of course.

17:12.920 --> 17:14.250
What's the matter?

17:14.250 --> 17:16.090
There was no octopus in that one...

17:18.200 --> 17:20.230
And that one had two!

17:20.230 --> 17:22.350
That cycle of rebirth is too quick.

17:23.520 --> 17:25.600
Otonashi-san, want to try one?

17:26.060 --> 17:28.600
Here! Open wide!

17:34.210 --> 17:35.680
Aw...

17:35.680 --> 17:36.720
Delicious!

17:36.720 --> 17:38.320
They are, right?

17:38.320 --> 17:39.860
Saejima-kun, try one...

17:41.800 --> 17:43.880
What? He's gone...

17:46.370 --> 17:49.380
<b>Fortunes</b>

17:57.810 --> 18:00.760
<i>She sure is pretty.</i>

18:00.760 --> 18:04.220
<i>I'm gonna pray that I can visit 
a shrine with her next year, too!</i>

18:06.640 --> 18:08.520
It seems increasingly crowded.

18:08.520 --> 18:10.010
You could get swept away.

18:10.010 --> 18:12.530
V-Very true.

18:15.900 --> 18:17.840
Fuyutsuki-san!

18:19.820 --> 18:21.560
That was close.

18:21.560 --> 18:23.160
Are you all right, Fuyutsu—

18:30.550 --> 18:33.020
I-I-I'm sorry. I just...

18:33.020 --> 18:34.370
N-Not at all.

18:34.370 --> 18:35.550
Whee!

18:41.840 --> 18:45.310
W-Well... since it would be 
so easy to get separated,

18:45.800 --> 18:47.520
let's hold hands.

18:52.360 --> 18:54.670
Thank you.

19:00.570 --> 19:01.720
A blizzard?!

19:01.720 --> 19:02.590
Hey, there they are.

19:02.590 --> 19:03.670
That's convenient.

19:03.670 --> 19:06.490
Hey! Himuro!

19:08.960 --> 19:11.770
Thank goodness! We tried to find you!

19:11.770 --> 19:12.580
Huh?

19:12.580 --> 19:13.610
What's up?

19:13.940 --> 19:16.090
Why are you both all red?

19:16.090 --> 19:17.730
A-Are we?

19:17.730 --> 19:18.720
Surely not.

19:19.510 --> 19:20.960
Oh, hey!

19:23.720 --> 19:25.130
Komori-san?

19:25.530 --> 19:27.970
It's you guys!

19:27.970 --> 19:31.290
Why are you dressed like that, Komori-san?

19:31.290 --> 19:33.480
I'm helping with the business.

19:34.210 --> 19:37.270
My family owns this shrine.

19:37.270 --> 19:38.230
You live here?!

19:38.640 --> 19:43.030
That explains why she said 
she'd be busy on New Year's.

19:43.030 --> 19:44.240
Indeed.

19:44.560 --> 19:49.490
I'm dishing out sweet sake over there, 
so feel free to stop by later!

19:49.490 --> 19:50.410
Sure!

20:00.690 --> 20:03.820
<i>Himuro-kun and Fuyutsuki-san...</i>

20:03.810 --> 20:07.020
<i>They seem even closer than ever today!</i>

20:08.850 --> 20:11.290
Lucky ducks...

20:11.290 --> 20:15.420
If I didn't have to help all 
the time, I could join in.

20:16.890 --> 20:18.430
Komori-san.

20:18.920 --> 20:21.500
S-S-S-Saejima-kun!

20:21.500 --> 20:24.110
H-H-How long have you been standing there?!

20:24.110 --> 20:25.270
Well...

20:26.840 --> 20:29.780
Would you like this?

20:32.170 --> 20:33.440
A protective charm.

20:33.440 --> 20:35.560
I bought it since you couldn't come today...

20:35.560 --> 20:41.550
But I never dreamed this would 
turn out to be your family shrine.

20:42.860 --> 20:46.060
If you don't want it, though... I can keep it.

20:49.750 --> 20:51.060
I want it!

20:52.690 --> 20:54.200
Um, I m-mean...

20:54.200 --> 20:57.440
I-It's because our shrine's 
charms work really well...

20:59.480 --> 21:02.560
Th-Thank you.

21:04.320 --> 21:05.880
You're welcome.

21:11.950 --> 21:14.460
We finally made it.

21:19.640 --> 21:20.800
Himuro-kun.

21:23.440 --> 21:25.640
For your first shrine visit wish,

21:25.640 --> 21:29.100
they say it's best to make 
a resolution to the gods.

21:32.880 --> 21:34.710
<i>Let Fuyutsuki-san and me</i>

21:40.120 --> 21:42.790
<i>come here together again.</i>

23:17.500 --> 23:19.000
<b>Medium Luck</b>

23:19.420 --> 23:20.990
Thank goodness.

23:20.990 --> 23:24.230
Fuyutsuki-san, your birthday is next month?

23:24.230 --> 23:27.050
Yes, I was born in February.

23:27.050 --> 23:29.530
<i>Fuyutsuki-san's birthday?</i>

23:31.510 --> 23:35.010
<b>Overall Luck:</b>

23:32.640 --> 23:35.010
<b>Like a violent storm</b>

23:35.400 --> 23:37.610
<i>A... A storm?!</i>
